  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff of Subchain City's forgotten data farms, 'Lil' Plaguie' has always been a survivor. The Dragon Pants weren't just a fashion statement; they were scavenged from a bio-containment suit, offering a sliver of protection against the ever-present grime and decay of Street Yay Blvd.",
    "class": "Plague Doctor",
    "name": "Lil' Plaguie",
    "personality": "Sarcastic and cynical, Lil' Plaguie uses dark humor to cope with the grim realities of Subchain City. Despite a rough exterior, they possess a surprising amount of empathy for the downtrodden, often using his medical knowledge to help those in need (for a price, of course). Resourceful and adaptable, Lil' Plaguie won't hesitate to cut corners to survive.",
